            "<span style=\"color:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (confirmResult.paymentResult </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> PaymentFlowEventsEnum.Completed) {</span>",
            "<span style=\"color:#a0aab5\">    // Happy path</span>",
            "<span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }</span>",
            "<span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">})();</span>",
